  imageFadingSpeed: 1.5
  hintList:
  - The cities fell in days. The screams still echo.
  - Running is sometimes better than fighting.
  - Aim for the head. Always.
  - "If you smell something awful - it\u2019s either a corpse or dinner."
  - Healing takes time - cover your teammates.
  - Ammo is scarce - make every shot count.
  - Trust is deadlier than the infected.
  - The world ended not with a bang, but with a bite.
  - Every bullet you fire writes another line in your story.
  - "Zombies don\u2019t need to reload. You do."
  - Running is a tactic, not a weakness.
  - "Humanity isn\u2019t gone. It\u2019s just\u2026 changed."
